{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111718","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111718/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111718/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111718/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111718","id":3521739199,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7R6Xm_","number":111718,"title":"Touchscreen event handling in a 2-in-1 laptop","user":{"login":"Theklo-Teal","id":226267175,"node_id":"U_kgDODXyQJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226267175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal","html_url":"https://github.com/Theklo-Teal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theklo-Teal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-16T12:44:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T22:47:53Z","closed_at":"2025-10-16T22:47:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.5-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Linux Mint 22.2 (Zara) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Graphics (RPL-U) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1334U (12 threads) - 15.34 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis computer is a Framework 12 combination tablet-laptop, which has a touch screen. It so happens that the the event handling, like in `func _gui_input(event):` recognizes the screen being dragged, but produces no events in the class `InputEventGesture` or sub-classes, like `InputEventMagnifyGesture`.\n\nI first realized this when testing [GodSVG](https://github.com/MewPurPur/GodSVG), which the author confirmed to be designed to receive touchscreen gestures. So I made my own test, where a `ColorRect` can be touched on the screen or clicked with a mouse and it will display a blue circle at event position as well as print a message about which event was detected. The mouse clicks work fine and the trackpad of the laptop produces such events as you'd expect, but touchscreen gestures don't print or display anything, although `event.as_string()` recognizes them. You can read the script attached to scene in the attached file.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIncluded in the MRP, there's a scene with an attached script. Just execute that scene on a computer with a touchscreen and observe if console printing displays \"panning...\" or \"zooming...\" messages. A blue circle should also appear on the screen where it was touched.\n\nI don't have means to test whether this issue is specific to the computer, touchscreen or drivers I'm using.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[touchscreen_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22949569/touchscreen_test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https: